sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: Nick 2026-11-03, single-swamp-node, rules 14-25.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: route:destroy
  %% kind: route.destroy
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  %% lane V icon=server pill=target tone=purple
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Route Nodes<br/>workload · Router
  participant V as VPN Node<br/>private DNS
  CLI->>GW: route:destroy 14
  Note over GW: Guard, capture placements<br/>Route 14 retiring · task #5130
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-route-removal
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5130
  opt --offline
    SW->>N: Check each Node answers<br/>@swamp/ssh · true
    %%> An unreachable Node keeps residue for node:converge. The VPN Node is always required.
  end
  opt domain outside the TLD
  SW->>V: Remove private DNS<br/>records + catalog, then reload
  Note over SW: Wait the DNS grace<br/>31 s: TTL 30 s + 1 s
  end
  SW->>N: Withdraw site, remove cert<br/>@swamp/cfgmgmt/file absent
  opt development targets
    SW->>N: Converge PHP-FPM pools<br/>php-fpm -t, then reload
  end
  opt Cluster-scoped or public
  SW->>N: Remove unused LAN rules<br/>@swamp/cfgmgmt/firewall absent
  end
  SW->>N: Check nothing is left<br/>cfgmgmt check · native assert
  alt every step succeeds
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Delete the Route record<br/>task succeeded · residues kept
  else a step fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code, failed step
    Note over GW: Mark the Route failed<br/>record kept · rerun after a fix
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5130
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
